      "description": "StartFragment\n\n```\nTelegram Onboarding — QA Preparation\nEndpoint:\nPOST /api/v1/leads/{id}/telegram/onboarding?event_id=...\nPurpose:\nVerify Telegram onboarding for an existing lead.\nPreconditions:\n- Valid lead ID\n- Valid event ID belonging to the organization\n- Authorized service credentials\nExpected Behavior:\nThe backend processes onboarding according to the API contract.\nActual: NOT EXECUTED\nStatus: REQUIRES CONTRACT\nLimitations:\n- Backend is currently unavailable.\n- Service credentials are not provided.\n- No real requests will be executed.\n- No tokens or results will be invented\n\n ```\n\nEndFragment"
